source RFC 7748, section 5, Montgomery ladder; a24=(a-2)/4 convention, https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7748#section-5
parameter a24
assume a24 = (a-2)/4
compute A = X1+Z1
compute AA = A^2
compute B = X1-Z1
compute BB = B^2
compute E = AA-BB
compute X3 = AA*BB
compute t0 = a24*E
compute t1 = AA+t0
compute Z3 = E*t1
